@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# FidelityFX API headers (FSR 3.1)
+
+The ffx-api headers the GPU plugin compiles its FSR 3.1 calls against
+(`ffx_api.h`, `ffx_api_types.h`, `ffx_upscale.h`, `dx12/ffx_api_dx12.h`,
+`vk/ffx_api_vk.h`), unmodified, from the AMD FidelityFX SDK 1.1.4 as carried by
+https://github.com/rexglue/FidelityFX-SDK at commit
+eee08db1688ac3d1275a70b728f4a8ba22914213 (AMD's v1.1.4 plus portability fixes).
+MIT licence: `LICENSE.txt`.
+
+The runtime (`amd_fidelityfx_dx12.dll`, `amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll`) is built from
+that commit's source by `cmake/rexglue_fsr.cmake` when `REXGLUE_ENABLE_FSR` is on,
+and loaded at run time from the plugin's folder.
